{"hw":"ἐξιόω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">ἐξιόω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">ἐξιόω</span>, (<span class=\"lex-etym gk\">ἰός</span>) <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">clean from rust,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Epict.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.11.13</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">PLeid.X.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6</span> </span>:—<span class=\"lex-gram\"> <span class=\"lex-gram\">Pass.</span> </span>, <b class=\"lex-tr\">to be freed from rust,</b> ib.<span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10</span> </span>; <b class=\"lex-tr\">from poison,</b> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Aët.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">8.16</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">make poisonous,</b> <span class=\"gk\">τοὺς χυμούς</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Herod.Med.</span> </span> in <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Rh.Mus.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">58.104</span> </span>.</div></div>"}